@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false


actor Editor
participant "AddCityUI" as UI

autonumber

Editor -> UI : Initiates "Add City" process
activate UI
note right of UI : UI shows the list of available maps\nso the Editor can choose where to place the city.

UI --> Editor : Display available maps
Editor -> UI : Selects a map from the list

note right of UI : The selected map becomes the current\nworking map for this operation.
@enduml
